%tr{style: (orderpart.kzaiko == "^" ? "background-color: #00ffff;" : nil)}
  -# 「順」を押すと注文部品詳細編集(旧 partsin2.asp)へ。順が空でも押せるように「-」を出す
  %td{style:'text-align:right'}= link_to((orderpart.sno.nil? ? "-" : orderpart.sno), edit_orderpart_path(orderpart))
  - if part_source == :part
    %td= (link_to orderpart.partno, parts_path+"/#{part.id}")+ orderpart.kzaiko
  - elsif part_source == :kepart
    %td= (link_to orderpart.partno, keparts_path+"/#{part.id}")+ orderpart.kzaiko
  - else
    %td= ''
  %td= orderpart.itemno
  %td= part&.jname
  %td= orderpart.info
  -# 掛け率は旧partsin.aspと同じく、A部品は注文のA部品掛け率、B部品は個別掛け率か注文のB部品共通掛け率
  - rate = ItemPricing.effective_rate(@order, part_source, orderpart.irate)
  %td{style:'text-align:right'}= rate
  %td{style:'text-align:right'}= orderpart.qty
  %td= orderpart.unit.presence || part&.sel_unit
  %td{style:'text-align:right'}= orderpart.bqty
  %td{style:'text-align:right'}= orderpart.totalweight&.round(2)
  -# 単価・金額は旧partsin.aspと同じ求め方(掛け率を掛けて切り上げまるめ。バラ売りはバラ単価)
  - pricing = ItemPricing.for_orderpart(orderpart, sel: orderpart.unit.presence || part&.sel_unit, rate: rate)
  %td{style:'text-align:right'}= pricing.price.to_s.gsub(/(?<=\d)(?=(?:\d{3})+(?!\d))/, ',')
  %td{style:'text-align:right'}= pricing.amount.to_s.gsub(/(?<=\d)(?=(?:\d{3})+(?!\d))/, ',')
  %td.updated-at-col{style: 'font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.1;'}= orderpart.updated_at.strftime('%Y/%m/%d %H:%M')
